                                                "text": "“Well, all I can say is that if yer don't take yer dial outer the road I'll bloomin' well take an' bounce a gibber off yer crust.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8bb9ef8-03f1-4b55-94a3-0bee243671b7",
                                                "sense_id": "b5d40f4f-64da-32bc-8beb-b0f4fc54dfa1",
                                                "text": "It had been his intention to go to Wimbledon, but as he himself said: “Why be blooming well frizzled when you can hear all the results over the wireless. And results are all that concern me. […]”"
                                            }
